政，妻子不免饑寒，時號廉平。王敬則作亂，瞻赴都，敬則經晉陵郡，人多附之。敬則敗，台軍討賊黨，瞻言愚人易動，不足窮法。齊明帝從之。所全萬數。遷御史中丞。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":6,"end":8,"surface":"王晏","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangzhan:p002:m0006","person_id":"i08_s4b_5bb","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作王晏。"},{"start":11,"end":12,"surface":"晏","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangzhan:p002:m0011","person_id":"i08_s4b_5bb","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作王晏。"},{"start":27,"end":28,"surface":"子","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangzhan:p002:u0027","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"子女或兒子集合，文中沒有指定長玄或生母。"},{"start":38,"end":41,"surface":"王敬則","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangzhan:p002:m0038","person_id":"7a0_95e_c4a","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作王敬則。"},{"start":44,"end":45,"surface":"瞻","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangzhan:p002:m0044","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAACAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作瞻。"},{"start":48,"end":50,"surface":"敬則","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangzhan:p002:m0048","person_id":"7a0_95e_c4a","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作王敬則。"},{"start":60,"end":62,"surface":"敬則","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangzhan:p002:m0060","person_id":"7a0_95e_c4a","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作王敬則。"},{"start":70,"end":71,"surface":"瞻","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangzhan:p002:m0070","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAACAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作瞻。"}],"source_position":{"revision_id":1752646,"source_layer":"received_biography","raw_start":6578,"raw_end":6677,"raw_character_offsets":[6578,6579,6580,6581,6582,6583,6584,6585,6586,6587,6588,6589,6590,6591,6592,6593,6594,6595,6596,6597,6598,6599,6600,6601,6602,6603,6604,6605,6606,6607,6608,6609,6610,